            "description": "Filter by the ruling of the operative part (référentiel solution). REJET / IRRECEVABILITE / DESISTEMENT / NON_LIEU_A_STATUER are procedural or negative endings; CONFIRMATION / INFIRMATION* / REFORMATION are appeal outcomes; CASSATION* is cassation-specific; ANNULATION covers administrative annulment; SATISFACTION_TOTALE / SATISFACTION_PARTIELLE cover first-instance civil rulings granting the claim."
